  "description": "Double Peak 27.5 Comp utilizes a low stand over, low center of gravity designed frame made from 6000 series alloy, an internal head tube, and internal cable routing. DP Comp, features a lightweight and versatile 1 X 10 speed semi-complete Deore drive train assisted by an FSA Comet Modular 1x30t crankset. Upgraded Xc-180 32 hole alloy wheelset is nicely finished with Kenda Honey badger 27.5\" x 2.2\" tires. The front end features an upgraded Suntour XCM 100mm fork with hydraulic lockout. An extremely capable cross country performance bike the Comp fly's but always lands safely thanks to Shimano's M-365 Hydraulic disc brake set.\nDouble Peak 6000 Series alloy frame w/ internal routing\nNew Suntour XCM 100mm travel fork w/ hydraulic lockout\nFSA Comet Modular 1x 30t crankset\nNew Shimano Deore 6000 rear derailleur & shifter\nNew Shimano Deore 10-spd 11-42T cassette\nWTB Werewolf grips and Rocket Sport saddle\nKenda Honey Badger XC 2.2\" tires\nWeinmann XC-180 Disc alloy DW 28h rims\nShimano M365 hydraulic disc brakeset",
